 ('Reading · A cartoon',comic('The Expert Panel',[dict(scene='📈',bubbles=[('Expert A','Our model accounts for everything.'),('Expert B','Everything except the last ten years.')],cap='Panel 1'),dict(scene='🔮',bubbles=[('Host','If you had predicted the crisis, we would be listening more carefully now.'),('Expert A','If the data had been better, I would have.')],cap='Panel 2'),dict(scene='🎩',bubbles=[('Expert B','Next year the model will be perfect.'),('Host','Be that as it may, I suggest that we ask the audience.')],cap='Panel 3')],gloss=[('expert','especialista'),('predict','prever'),('crisis','crise'),('audience','plateia')],say='Review the cartoon: criteria, evidence, verdict.')),
 [('Expert A says the model leaves out nothing.','T','accounts for everything.'),('The host says the experts predicted the crisis.','F','If you had predicted.'),('The host suggests asking the audience.','T','ask the audience.')],
 [('“predict” = ?',['prever','predizer só','prender'],0,'predict = prever.'),('“expert” = ?',['especialista','expressivo','explorador'],0,'expert = especialista.')],
 G('Estrutura da resenha de uma charge',['Parte','Frases-modelo'],[['Resumo','The cartoon shows… / It mocks…'],['Critérios','I will judge its wit, its message and its clarity.'],['Evidência','The line “Everything except the last ten years” shows…'],['Fraqueza','However, the joke relies on…'],['Veredito','On balance, it is sharp, although…']],'Uma resenha crítica de uma charge: **o que mostra, o que critica, como faz isso (humor, exagero), se funciona**. Use verbos como **mocks, satirises, exposes**.'),
 [('The cartoon ___ the overconfidence of experts. (mock)','mocks','verbo.',None),('The line “Everything except…” ___ the point. (make)','makes','evidência.',None),('If the data had been better, I ___ have predicted it. (would)','would','3º tipo.',None),('On ___ , the cartoon is sharp. (balance)','balance','veredito.',None)],
 V('expert panel=painel de especialistas|economic forecast=previsão econômica|failed prediction=previsão que falhou|model overconfidence=excesso de confiança no modelo|financial crisis=crise financeira|crisis warning=aviso de crise|data limitation=limitação dos dados|talk-show host=apresentador de talk show|studio audience=plateia de estúdio|satirical cartoon=charge satírica|visual exaggeration=exagero visual|deadpan delivery=entrega impassível|punchline timing=timing da piada|cartoonist’s target=alvo do cartunista|shrewd observation=observação perspicaz|biting wit=sagacidade mordaz|critical production=produção crítica|review draft=rascunho da resenha|evidence quotation=citação de evidência|balanced verdict=veredito equilibrado|clarity of message=clareza da mensagem|visual detail=detalhe visual|panel sequence=sequência de quadros|speech balloon=balão de fala|caption wording=texto da legenda|comic review=resenha de quadrinhos|final judgement=julgamento final|word choice review=revisão da escolha de palavras'),
 ('Review workshop',[('Tutor','What does the cartoon mock?','O que a charge ridiculariza?'),('Student','The overconfidence of economic experts.','O excesso de confiança de especialistas econômicos.'),('Tutor','Which line is your evidence?','Qual fala é sua evidência?'),('Student','“Everything except the last ten years.”','“Everything except the last ten years.”')]),
 [('Summarise what the cartoon shows.','Resuma.','It shows experts defending a failed model.'),('Cite your evidence.','Cite.','The line “Everything except the last ten years” mocks the model.'),('Give your verdict.','Opine.','On balance, it is sharp, although its target is narrow.')],
 ('Write a critical review (8 sentences) of the cartoon or of a short article: summary, criteria, strengths, weakness, verdict.','The cartoon shows experts defending a model that failed. It mocks overconfidence. I will judge its wit, its message and its clarity. The line “Everything except the last ten years” is a sharp piece of evidence. Its message is clear, and its humour is dry. However, it exaggerates by treating all experts alike. If the cartoonist had added one thoughtful expert, the satire would be fairer. On balance, it is sharp, although unbalanced.',['Resumi','Dei **critérios** e **evidência**','Usei **uma condicional**','Dei **veredito**'],'8 frases'),
